1502	// brainBriefFactsCount sizes the brief's facts section to the requested brief
1503	// limit so a compact request (e.g. the Opus compact mode's limit 3, or the
1504	// MCP brain_brief limit) gets fewer facts instead of a fixed block. Facts are a
1505	// supplementary section, so they never exceed brainBriefFactsLimit and shrink
1506	// with the budget; at least one fact is kept whenever the section is shown.
